000200 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000300 PROGRAM-ID.          CJULIAN.
000400 AUTHOR.              PD RAGLOW.
000500 DATE-WRITTEN.        MARCH 1992.
000600 DATE-COMPILED.
000700*INSTALLATION.        GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER - AKRON.
000800*SECURITY.
000900*REMARKS.   THIS SUBPROGRAM CALCULATES THE JULIAN DATE GIVEN THE
001000*           GREGORIAN DATE OR THE GREGORIAN DATE GIVEN THE JULIAN
001100*           DATE.
001200
001300 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
001400 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
001500 SOURCE-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
001600 OBJECT-COMPUTER.  HP-3000.
001700 DATA DIVISION.
001800 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
001900 01  WHO-CARES                     PIC 9(4).
001900 01  MOD-4                         PIC 9(4).
001900 01  MOD-100                       PIC 9(4).
001900 01  MOD-400                       PIC 9(4).
001900 01  LY                            PIC 9(4).
001900 01  G-DAY                         PIC 9(4).
001900 01  G-MONTH                       PIC 9(4).
001900 01  TEST-IT                       PIC 9(4).

003500 LINKAGE SECTION.
003600 01  YEAR                          PIC 9999.
003700 01  GREG-MM                       PIC 99.
004000 01  GREG-MM-X REDEFINES GREG-MM   PIC XX.
004100 01  GREG-DD                       PIC 99.
004200 01  GREG-DD-X REDEFINES GREG-DD   PIC XX.
006900 01  JULIAN-DDD                    PIC 999.
006900 01  JULIAN-DDD-X REDEFINES JULIAN-DDD
007000                                   PIC XXX.

007100 PROCEDURE DIVISION USING YEAR, GREG-MM, GREG-DD, JULIAN-DDD.

       6000-MAIN.
007700*------- IT'S A LEAP YEAR EVERY 4TH YEAR, EXCEPT EVERY 100TH YEAR
007800*------- IS NOT A LEAP YEAR UNLESS ITS THE 400TH YEAR THEN IT IS
007900*------- A LEAP YEAR.  GOT IT???
008100     DIVIDE YEAR BY 4   GIVING WHO-CARES REMAINDER MOD-4.
008100     DIVIDE YEAR BY 100 GIVING WHO-CARES REMAINDER MOD-100.
008100     DIVIDE YEAR BY 400 GIVING WHO-CARES REMAINDER MOD-400.
008400     MOVE ZERO TO LY.
008500     IF (MOD-4 = 0) AND (MOD-400 = 0 OR (MOD-100 NOT = 0))
008600       MOVE 1  TO LY.

           IF JULIAN-DDD-X = ZERO OR SPACES
             COMPUTE JULIAN-DDD = 3055 * (GREG-MM + 2) / 100 -
                                  (GREG-MM + 10) / 13 * 2 - 91 +
                                  LY * (GREG-MM + 10) / 13 + GREG-DD
           ELSE
             PERFORM 7100-COMPUTE-GREGORIAN THRU 7190-CG-X.

       6990-MAIN-X.
           GOBACK.

       7100-COMPUTE-GREGORIAN.
           COMPUTE TEST-IT = 59 + LY.
           IF JULIAN-DDD > TEST-IT
             COMPUTE G-DAY = JULIAN-DDD + 2 - LY
           ELSE
             MOVE JULIAN-DDD TO G-DAY.

           COMPUTE G-MONTH = (G-DAY + 91) * 100 / 3055.
           COMPUTE G-DAY   = (G-DAY + 91) - (G-MONTH * 3055) / 100.
           COMPUTE G-MONTH =  G-MONTH - 2.
           MOVE G-MONTH       TO GREG-MM.
           MOVE G-DAY         TO GREG-DD.
       7190-CG-X.
           EXIT.
